摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"OpenAI-compatible multi-account Codex and vibe coding proxy","id":"gh:1168322081","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"multivibe","slug":"thibautrey/multivibe","topics":["codex","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","lechat","mistral","moltbot","multi-account","mutli-agent","openai","openai-codex","openclaw","openrouter","proxy","qwen","vibe-coding","vibecoding"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"OpenAI-compatible multi-account Codex and vibe coding proxy"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"Your providers. Your hardware. One AI gateway."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A free, self-hosted gateway for coding agents and AI apps."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Connect provider accounts, route around quotas, and use your preferred AI providers."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Download MultiVibe Host ·\nRun the gateway ·\nExplore the API ·\nContribute"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Current dashboard · Fictional data from the local demo instance"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## ✨ At a glance"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| One endpoint | Resilient routing | Your infrastructure |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Connect OpenAI-compatible clients, Codex, and Anthropic Messages clients. | Discover models, balan"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ce quota headroom, and fail over between accounts. | Self-host the gateway or run the complete Host "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"on supported hardware. |\n| Responses, Chat Completions, SSE, Realtime, and WebSocket support. | Add "},{"id":"p9s4","text":"model aliases, local/cloud policies, budgets, and deferred jobs. | Manage API keys, inspect traces, "},{"id":"p9s5","text":"and track tokens, costs, and latency. |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Full capabilities and gateway architecture"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Area | What MultiVibe provides |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Client APIs | Responses, Chat Completions, Anthropic Messages, models, Realtime WebRTC, cascaded R"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ealtime voice over WebSocket, SSE, and Responses over WebSocket |\n| Providers | OpenAI/ChatGPT, GitH"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ub Copilot, Poe, MiniMax, OpenRouter, Abacus.AI, Manus, Kimi, Hugging Face, Mammouth AI, Qwen Coding"},{"id":"p12s4","text":" Plan, Z.AI GLM Coding Plan, Perplexity, Grok Build, OpenCode Zen/Go, Mistral, and other reviewed or"},{"id":"p12s5","text":" custom APIs. See provider setup and quota coverage. |\n| Account routing | Automatic model discovery"},{"id":"p12s6","text":", quota headroom selection, account/model blocks, retries, and optional Codex session affinity |\n| S"},{"id":"p12s7","text":"mart aliases | Conditional schema-v2 policies, local/cloud candidates, capacity constraints, scoring"},{"id":"p12s8","text":", budgets, simulation, and queue/reject fallbacks |\n| Deferred work | Durable edge jobs, priority an"},{"id":"p12s9","text":"d application fairness, idempotency, polling/SSE results, cancellation, and signed webhooks |\n| Oper"},{"id":"p12s10","text":"ations | Admin dashboard, lifecycle plugins, dynamic application API keys, traces, cost/token/latenc"},{"id":"p12s11","text":"y statistics, project attribution, exports, and Sentry integration |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"MultiVibe exposes the same inference routes under `/v1` and at the root for\nclients that expect eith"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"er style. In the shipped Compose profile, the public\n`:1455` socket is served directly by the native"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" Rust edge; Node.js remains on\nloopback `127.0.0.1:1456` for the dashboard UI, OAuth, static assets,"},{"id":"p13s4","text":" and the\ndashboard resource routes that have not yet migrated. Rust owns dashboard\nsession authentic"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"ation, the outer admin access guard, health, the read-only API\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Find your way"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Get started | Use the gateway | Operate and extend |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Download the Host | Providers and onboarding | Tracing and projects |\n| Gateway quick start | API "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"reference and examples | Storage and local models |\n| Dashboard tour | Routing and aliases | Configu"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"ration |\n| Installation guide | Realtime voice gateway · Audio and live voice · Plugin API | Develop"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"ation guide | Realtime voice gateway · Audio and live voice · Plugin API | Development · More docs |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## ⬇️ Download MultiVibe Host"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"MultiVibe Host is the fastest way to run the complete, security-bounded local\nHost: gateway, dashboa"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"rd, private device identity, provider agent, and managed\nmodel runtime. Official builds are publishe"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"d together in one verified release."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Platform | Official package | Requirements | Download |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| **macOS** | Signed and notarized `.dmg` for Apple Silicon and Intel | Apple Silicon (`arm64`) or I"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ntel (`amd64`) Mac | **Download the latest macOS release →** |\n| **Linux** | Signed native Host arch"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ive | Linux `x86_64` | **Download the latest Linux release →** |\n| **Windows** | Verified native `.z"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"ip` for amd64 | Windows amd64 | **Download the latest Windows release →** |\n| **Docker / Unraid** | "},{"id":"p20s5","text":"Hardened image on GitHub Container Registry | Linux `x86_64`, Docker or Unraid | **Open the latest D"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"itHub Container Registry | Linux `x86_64`, Docker or Unraid | **Open the latest Docker release →** |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"macOS installation"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### macOS"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Open the latest release and choose the disk image for your Mac:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- `darwin_arm64.dmg` for Apple Silicon (M1 or newer)\n- `darwin_amd64.dmg` for Intel"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Open the DMG, drag **MultiVibe Host** to **Applications**, then launch it. The\napp is signed with De"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"veloper ID, notarized by Apple, and runs from the menu bar.\nIts menu-bar label follows the provider "},{"id":"p25s3","text":"used most recently and shows that\nprovider's remaining capacity: quota windows when it bills a subsc"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"ription, or\nthe remaining prepaid credit in its own currency when it bills pay-as-you-go.\nOpening it"},{"id":"p25s5","text":" presents a native account overview with per-account quota windows,\ncredit balances, reset times, an"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"d health without exposing account tokens to the\ninterface process."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Linux installation"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Linux"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Download the Linux `amd64` release assets and follow `NATIVE-MULTIPART.txt` when\nthe archive is spli"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"t into several parts. After reconstructing and extracting\nthe archive, run:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The installer verifies the release bundle before it\nstarts the Host. It installs for the current use"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"r and does not require root.\nOn systems with a user systemd manager it also enables the signed autom"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"atic\nupdate timer. The timer checks hourly but the updater itself schedules one\nnetwork check every "},{"id":"p30s4","text":"10 to 14 hours with a local random offset."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Windows installation"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### Windows"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Download the `windows_amd64.zip` release, extract it to a temporary directory,\nthen run PowerShell a"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ws_amd64.zip` release, extract it to a temporary directory,\nthen run PowerShell as the current user:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"The installer verifies the complete bundle before changing the machine.\nIt requires Windows amd64, i"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"nstalls without administrator privileges, and\nregisters a per-user Start Menu shortcut, login entry,"},{"id":"p35s3","text":" `multivibe://` protocol\nhandler, and scheduled update task. The native Win32 tray menu starts and\ns"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"tops the Host and opens the local dashboard. Application files are kept under\n`%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Progra"},{"id":"p35s5","text":"ms\\MultiVibe Host`; private state and logs remain under\n`%LOCALAPPDATA%\\MultiVibe`."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"PowerShell 5.1 or newer is required. The Windows updater verifies the signed\nfeed and ZIP contents, "},{"id":"p36s2","text":"stops only MultiVibe processes whose executable paths\nbelong to the managed installation, and restor"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"es the previous version if the\nnew Host does not pass its health check."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Docker and Unraid installation"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
